@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>IPCamLapse has no analytics, advertising, telemetry, or cloud storage.</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Local data</h2>
<p>Settings, frames, and videos are stored in <code>data/sessions</code>. Camera passwords are protected at rest with ASP.NET Core Data Protection.</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Network</h2>
<p>The app connects to the camera endpoints you configure. It uses an anti-forgery cookie, not tracking cookies.</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Deletion</h2>
<p>Deleting a session removes its app-managed settings, frames, and videos. External backups may retain copies.</p>
